# 凭证 —— 让「不可能被提交」成为机制,而不是运气
.env
.env.*
*.key
*.pem
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa*
.openai_key
.minimax_key
*_secret*
*secrets.json
credentials.json

# ...but NOT the scanner itself. `*_secret*` above matches `scan_secrets.py`, so the credential
# scanner was silently excluded from every commit: it ran clean locally, SECURITY.md told people
# to run it, three CI steps invoked it, and no clone ever contained it. Over-matching is the
# right default for credential patterns — so keep the pattern and name the exception.
# `scripts/check_repo_integrity.py` fails the build if this class recurs.
!scripts/scan_secrets.py

# lint_fixture.py build artifacts — regenerated by the test suite on every run.
# Deliberately NARROW: an over-broad pattern here is what hid scan_secrets.py.
skills/slide-maker/tests/fx_pass.pptx
skills/slide-maker/tests/fx_fail.pptx
skills/slide-maker/tests/_fixture_plate.png

# 本地安装产物 / 工作笔记 —— 不进仓库
# .agents/ 与 .claude/ 是 skill 被安装到本机后的副本（`npx skills add` / 符号链接目标），
# 会与 skills/ 下的真身漂移（实测 17 个文件已不一致），提交它们等于发布一份过时的重复品。
.agents/
.claude/
skills-lock.json
OPTIMIZATION_SUMMARY.md

# Render output that lands in the repo when render_deck.py is run without an out dir
